          }
        ],
        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "+1 (866) 973-4491 INFO@RANCHROOFING.COM Roofing Residential Roofing Condominium Roofing Commercial Roofing Skylights Resources Our Roofing Process Choosing a Roofer Galleries Customer Testimonials Service Area About Us Contact Roofing Residential Roofing Condominium Roofing Commercial Roofing Skylights Resources Our Roofing Process Choosing a Roofer Galleries Customer Testimonials Service Area About Us Contact Free Estimate It's Not Just the Roof, It's the People Under It. At Ranch Roofing, your roof is our top priority. We&#8217;ve spent over 30 years earning the trust of our neighbors, one roof at a time. We show up on time, treat every job with care, and stand behind every roof we install."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Whether you need a full roof replacement or a roof repair, you&#8217;ll get the same commitment to craftsmanship and customer service that&#8217;s kept us trusted locally for over 30 years."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h1",
            "text": "It's Not Just the Roof, It's the People Under It."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Get a Free Estimate"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "About Us"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Our approach is simple: be honest, be prepared, and do the work the right way. That commitment has earned us long-term relationships, repeat customers, and recommendations we’re proud of."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "We don’t cut corners, we don’t disappear after install, and we don’t consider the job complete until you’re confident in the result."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Services"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Residential Roofing"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "From everyday repairs to full roof replacements, our team delivers durable, beautifully finished roofs with the kind of care that turns customers into neighbors for life."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More Condo Roofing Condominium associations and multi-owner properties, we install thoughtfully planned, high-quality roofing systems with clear communication and the trusted expertise needed to protect every resident’s investment."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More Skylights Enhance your home with expertly installed and reliably serviced skylights that bring natural light indoors while maintaining the durability, weather protection, and attention to detail you expect."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More Commercial Roofing For businesses large and small, we provide high-quality roofing and systems backed by honest guidance and service you can trust from start to finish."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More Get a Free Estimate Testimonials Real experiences. Real Results. Don&#8217;t just take our word for it, see why businesses and homeowners choose us."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Why Choose Us?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "We believe every shingle matters and every homeowner counts, which is why we raise the standard in roofing and stand by our roofs long after the job is done."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Expert Care We have been the leading roofing company in Arlington and the surrounding area since 1996. Backed by professionals and your neighbors."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Convenient Scheduling From responsive scheduling to smooth project coordination, we make roofing straightforward and stress-free from first call to final walkthrough."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Quality Work Our work is defined by precision, durability, and a commitment to doing the job right, so your roof stands strong long after the project is complete."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Reliable Guarantee A reliable guarantee isn’t just a promise; it’s our commitment to quality workmanship and being there if you ever need us. We won't disappear after the job is done."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Professional Team Ranch Roofing in Arlington brings experience, accountability, and respect to every job. Showing up prepared, communicating clearly, and taking pride in treating every customer with care."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Lifetime Relationships By standing behind our work and showing up for our customers year after year, we build relationships designed to last a lifetime, rooted in dedication and follow-through."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Hundreds"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Of Five Star Reviews"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Thousands"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Of Happy Customers"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Certifications and Warranties"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "We are GAF Master Elite Certified"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "GAF Master Elite® status is held by fewer than 2% of roofing contractors nationwide. Up to 25 years of workmanship coverage is backed directly by GAF. We handle registration so your coverage starts the day your roof is complete."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More We are Owens Corning Platinum Certified Owens Corning offers coverage for up to 50 years. As a certified Preferred Contractor, we make sure your roof qualifies for the best coverage available. We handle registration so you&#8217;re protected from day one."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn More We are Elevate Master Certified Elevate&#8217;s Red Shield™ warranty is one of the strongest 30-year term protections available in commercial roofing. As a licensed Elevate applicator, Ranch Roofing handles the pre-installation notice and warranty registration on your behalf."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Contact Us"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Ready for a Stronger roof? Book your free estimate today"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Some of the Communities We Serve"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Contact"
          },
          {
